{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bc5656780d69bfd9a392f9342d3d4432c0ac7f90ed1999a401e26e172567a021",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e280b73d472e8ef502258b96a58b35d3f263e390e33e1c7d1f1ebf6aa569a294",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，拍摄辛苦了！\n在雨中拍摄虽然相当不容易……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:448cdf515cb9f9c516016b8731cea2e6941ac86306ad4a898c60499c2f403209",
      "text": "但多亏了制作人和工作人员们一起\n坚持下来，才拍出了最棒的照片呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6233163fa1c71424738669eb880de95a2fbe88ddf541fd18f2b59f7f93d41362",
      "text": "这都是多亏了\n辉先生的干劲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93078919a4906626961daa64de8033fa5b7b083352b26b0f34d52d0b3a333ec2",
      "text": "是大家一起努力\n的成果呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b4c938d07c153349a598003212d4f6d705e118b305d1f03f2475e3d37b25ac5",
      "text": "哈哈，听你这么说我很高兴。\n不过，那正是因为有大家在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae74cc1b5bdabb504ac5bfbf6b34e82ade6e5ce356de7a629039f9deaefb9ab6",
      "text": "嗯。放晴那一瞬间的感动和一体感，\n让人终生难忘啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:911c0d0f16e2931268e66e304e8de731977c2c3b570a9a862563fb7e8da13842",
      "text": "制作人也一直守护着我，\n谢谢你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff56378634f15c3aeea7cd28c13db6d8e3c3dd5d1f16dd3b176c5668bc7284e3",
      "text": "能和信赖的伙伴像这样一起工作，\n再次感受到了内心的踏实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcedbdf968946afbfca9f95de4377687e435ccd411228e861e73b04ab396cf51",
      "text": "为了能和大家一起做好工作，\n我会竭尽全力的，今后也拜托你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "那当然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:728a8f9821f567cea9b3577e9bd2bead3f4399741f001fd20a2167ec1ccc8595",
      "text": "哦！刚才还在下的雨好像也停了。\n说不定是大家的热情把雨云吹散了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_402_2_4_004_02_09_a:2_4_004_02_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c425465bb588fce40b0ffd41a79d6f9bd2a12bc77ad4c82fc5e7ef7433d880f7",
      "text": "那我差不多该去下一个现场了。\n今天的工作也要全力以赴！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
